<title>USA: St Joseph hogs up $1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs up $1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said compared with</p>
<p>Tuesday, barrows and gilts were $1.50 higher. Top $54.00 per</p>
<p>cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	230-270 lbs    53.50-54.00</p>
<p>    Sows - steady. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-2	300-500 lbs    46.00-46.50</p>
<p>    US 1-3	500-550 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>		    550-700 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
<p>    Boars:	300-700 lbs    40.00, shpmnt 40.50</p>
</text>
